  {
   "id": "intro_1",
   "text": "11:52 pm. The storm took the street lights. Mira went out to check the car twenty minutes ago. The intercom crackles: both door cameras show her, at the front door and the side door, at the same time. One call, two entrances.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "intro_2",
   "text": "12:20 am. She calls again. Same coat, same voice, both doors. Before she went out she said: “If anything weird happens, don't open until you're sure.”",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "intro_3",
   "text": "1:05 am. The porch light on one side flickers. Another call. Tonight the call leans toward one of the doors.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "intro_4",
   "text": "3:33 am. The intercom battery is almost gone. One more call, and then the line is dead.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "res_saved",
   "text": "Took you long enough.",
   "voice": "mira",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
