   "voice": "mira",
   "fx": "eerie"
  },
  {
   "id": "stage_goal",
   "text": "Every call, two questions. Who is calling, and which door. Listen to learn who. Trace to learn where.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "stage_superposition",
   "text": "One call. Two doors. She is at both of them at once. That is superposition.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "stage_listen",
   "text": "Set the dial to zero, and press Listen.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "stage_interference",
   "text": "Now turn the dial to four, and listen again.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "stage_impostor",
   "text": "An impostor's pattern is shifted. Where Mira comes through clear, it gives static.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "stage_trace",
   "text": "Now trace the call. You will learn the door, and lose the pattern.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
